<title>USA: Barry's Jewelers CFO, CEO resign.</title>
<headline>Barry's Jewelers CFO, CEO resign.</headline>
<dateline>MONROVIA, Calif 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barry's Jewelers Inc said Friday that its president and chief executive, Robert Bridel, and its chief financial officer, Thomas Liston, have resigned.</p>
<p>The company provided no reason for the resignations of Bridel and Liston and could not be immediately reached for further comment.</p>
<p>The company said it has named Sam Merksamer, the founder of Merksamer Jewelers, as Bridel's successor. It said Merksamer would be buying 200,000 company shares.</p>
